>Youse</i> a cute kitty!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T17:40:59-07:00","id":862898,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/861879-regarding-the-aggiecon-thread-and-solars?p=862885#post862885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Kyman saying he enjoys playing X way is not him saying that you're wrong not to play X way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Try to follow me on this one.<br /> <br /> 1. I bring up a point of mechanical rigour.<br /> <br /> 2. The response to that is &quot;Some people DON'T CARE ABOUT THAT.&quot;<br /> <br /> 3. I suppose I could interpret that as an unrelated factoid, but I chose to view it as a reply addressing my point, since that is the way it was framed.<br /> <br /> 4. Once that conclusion is reached, Kyman is implying what ParanoidCombo is explicitly saying - that the proper response to an issue with the mechanics is to not care about the mechanics.<br /> <br /> Do you see a flaw in my logic?<br /> <br /> If I were to not care about mechanics, I would certainly not be playing a game with a lot of mechanics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4596-ren9077","name":"Ren9077","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"593"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T17:42:12-07:00","id":862901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Guancyto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/861879-regarding-the-aggiecon-thread-and-solars?p=862895#post862895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fourteen words: &quot;My ST wants to send my Solar to Yu-Shan. I think this is suicidal.&quot;<br /> <br /> This particular iteration of one guy being <i>really determined</i> to not be wrong is downright <i>adorable</i> by comparison.<br /> <br /> You want to pinch his cheeks and go, &quot;oh you're down to personal attacks now? You're almost starting to sound catty! Who's a cute kitty? <i>Youse</i> a cute kitty!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I need that Gold Bond myself now. This is some Grade A irony.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4596-ren9077","name":"Ren9077","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"593"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T17:44:36-07:00","id":862903,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ren9077</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/861879-regarding-the-aggiecon-thread-and-solars?p=862898#post862898\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Try to follow me on this one.<br /> <br /> 1. I bring up a point of mechanical rigour.<br /> <br /> 2. The response to that is &quot;Some people DON'T CARE ABOUT THAT.&quot;<br /> <br /> 3. I suppose I could interpret that as an unrelated factoid, but I chose to view it as a reply addressing my point, since that is the way it was framed.<br /> <br /> 4. Once that conclusion is reached, Kyman is implying what ParanoidCombo is explicitly saying - that the proper response to an issue with the mechanics is to not care about the mechanics.<br /> <br /> Do you see a flaw in my logic?<br /> <br /> If I were to not care about mechanics, I would certainly not be playing a game with a lot of mechanics.</div> </div> </div> </div>Your flaw is in assuming mechanical rigour TO THE DEGREE YOU WANT IT is expected or wanted and therefore is a GAME problem. It isn't. Mechanics exist for a lot of reasons, many of which, surprisingly, aren't about the mechanics themselves or any internally consistent set of principles. This is a YOU problem. Not a GAME problem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Incentive is not permission or justification.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/255-paranoiacombo","name":"ParanoiaCombo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar255_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016