ions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T17:57:30-07:00","id":862913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/861879-regarding-the-aggiecon-thread-and-solars?p=862906#post862906\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I assume Jay is referring to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/857980-thank-you-for-not-being-awful\">this thread</a>. I actually made it in response to the Tracer butt discussion on a different forum.<br /> <br /> No one has yet told anyone to kill themselves, called anyone a terrorist, or suggested sexual assault would solve the problem of people complaining about games. So, you know, we're far from awful.</div> </div> </div> </div>Coincidentally, I posted in that thread following a discussion about Tracer's butt. You think you know a guy and then they call you an extremist terrorist. Fun times.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">Bearer of the legacy of Trauma Bear<br /> Need a dice-roller? Check out <a href=\"http://bit.ly/dicemat\" target=\"_blank\">Dicemat</a>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/43-fata-ku","name":"Fata-Ku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar43_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2240"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T17:59:42-07:00","id":862915,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ParanoiaCombo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/861879-regarding-the-aggiecon-thread-and-solars?p=862903#post862903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Your flaw is in assuming mechanical rigour TO THE DEGREE YOU WANT IT is expected or wanted and therefore is a GAME problem. It isn't. Mechanics exist for a lot of reasons, many of which, surprisingly, aren't about the mechanics themselves or any internally consistent set of principles. This is a YOU problem. Not a GAME problem.</div> </div> </div> </div>This game has rules piled on top of rules. If you don't care about rules and balance, that's fine. If you can still find joy in this game despite all the rules, that's fine. However, because the game IS a very rules-heavy thing, I care about those rules, and when I'm concerned about the rules, if I'm right or wrong, I'm not wrong to BE CONCERNED.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4596-ren9077","name":"Ren9077","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"593"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T18:02:02-07:00","id":862916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>YeOfLittleFaith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/861879-regarding-the-aggiecon-thread-and-solars?p=862894#post862894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Of course the fallout was over that and not ridiculous or nonsensical lore progression/retcons. (&gt;w&lt;)<br /> ...<br /> <span style=\"font-size:9px\">[sobs]</span></div> </div> </div> </div>Hearing what Blizzard does to Warcraft lore makes me sad.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ren9077</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/861879-regarding-the-aggiecon-thread-and-solars?p=862915#post862915\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This game has rules piled on top of rules. If you don't care about rules and balance, that's fine. If you can still find joy in this game despite all the rules, that's fine. However, because the game IS a very rules-heavy thing, I care about those rules, and when I'm concerned about the rules, if I'm right or wrong, I'm not wrong to BE CONCERNED.</div> </div> </div> </div>With all due respect, your level of concern related to what we know is so lopsided that I can't even call it making a mountain out of a molehill. You're making a planetoid out of a dust mote. All we have heard are things like &quot;The Immaculate Styles will not have Mastery Keywords&quot;, and &quot;A Solar using Fire Dragon Style will still be effective, just not perhaps as optimized as if they had picked another Martial Arts style&quot;, and you're pretty much the only one who seems to think this represents a clear and present danger to the entire system.<br /> <br /> We <b>don't know enough</b> to make any calls about anything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":2142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","user":"Kyman201","date":". 04-09-2016, 09:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T18:03:23-07:00","id":862917,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">We don't need two threads of this. </span></b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}